Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,Row fifty one, a gala table sponsorship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:06.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Preparer put it on line six d, fundraising events.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.74,0:00:11.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Reviewer, working blind,\Nput it on line one, contributions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:16.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Referee ran, looked both lines up\Nwith the same tool, and chose six d.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:23.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Its reason is the IRS text itself, and Python\Nchecked the reason really came from the tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nothing is resolved silently.
